==English==
{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
From {{af|en|auto-|-cracy}}, from {{der|en|grc|αὐτοκρατία|t=A system of government by one person with absolute power.}}, from {{m|grc|αὐτός|t=single, self, same, alone}} + {{m|grc|κράτος|t=power}} + {{m|grc|-ία|t=feminine abstract nouns suffix}}; see also {{der|en|grc|αὐτοκρατής|t=one who governs alone}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|uncountable}} A form of [[government]] in which unlimited power is held by a single [[individual]].
# {{lb|en|countable}} An instance of this government.

